-- Questicus language pack: 简体中文 - the patch notes (What's new), one entry per line of Questicus/Changelog.lua
QuesticusLocales = QuesticusLocales or {}
local t = QuesticusLocales.zhCN or {}
QuesticusLocales.zhCN = t
t["Questicus in your language: German, French, Spanish (Spain and Mexico), Italian, Portuguese (Brazil), Russian, Korean and Chinese (simplified and traditional). Each language is a small language pack on the Questicus files page on CurseForge - install the one for your language next to Questicus."] = "Questicus 支持你的语言了：德语、法语、西班牙语（西班牙和墨西哥）、意大利语、葡萄牙语（巴西）、俄语、韩语和中文（简体和繁体）。每种语言都是 CurseForge 上 Questicus 文件页面中的一个小型语言包 - 在 Questicus 旁边安装你的语言包即可。"
t["Options > Language: every language with whether its pack is installed, a drop-down to pick one (Automatic follows the game's language), and a link to the files page."] = "选项 > 语言：列出每种语言及其语言包是否已安装，一个用来选择语言的下拉菜单（自动 = 跟随游戏语言），以及文件页面的链接。"
t["The first-time setup now starts with the language choice."] = "首次设置现在从选择语言开始。"
t["Escort quests stand out on the route: the step is green with an \"ESCORT QUEST\" tab, and before an escort starts Questicus asks (Start escort / Not now), even with auto-accept on."] = "护送任务在路线中更醒目：该步骤为绿色并带有“护送任务”标签，护送开始前 Questicus 会先询问（开始护送 / 暂不），即使开启了自动接受也一样。"
t["Options > Automation: every setting where Questicus does something on its own - accepting and handing in quests, suggesting rewards, taking flights, pinning the next objective."] = "选项 > 自动化：Questicus 自行处理的所有设置 - 接受和交付任务、推荐奖励、乘坐飞行、标记下一个目标。"
t["Accepting quests, handing them in and suggesting rewards are off until you turn them on (first-time setup or Options > Automation). They were on by default; after this update they're off once, so turn them back on if you want them."] = "接受任务、交付任务和推荐奖励在你开启之前都是关闭的（首次设置或选项 > 自动化）。之前默认是开启的；本次更新后会关闭一次，需要的话请重新开启。"
t["With Command Center installed, the Questicus icon in its dock, border bar, home page and Tools list takes the theme colour like the other tools; on its own Questicus keeps its own icon."] = "安装了 Command Center 时，Questicus 在其停靠栏、边栏、主页和工具列表中的图标会像其他工具一样使用主题颜色；单独使用时 Questicus 保留自己的图标。"
t["Game clients in other languages (German, French, Spanish ...): quest objectives in your log are recognised (by name in your language, else by kind and order), so finished objectives drop out of the route and progress shows; quest, NPC and item names show in your language where the game knows them."] = "其他语言的游戏客户端（德语、法语、西班牙语……）：能识别你日志中的任务目标（按你语言中的名称，否则按类型和顺序），所以已完成的目标会从路线中移除并显示进度；只要游戏知道，任务、NPC 和物品名称会以你的语言显示。"
t["Hearthstone in routes: when it's ready and your inn gets you to the next step faster, the route has a \"Hearth to <inn>\" step with a Hearthstone button. Questicus learns where your hearthstone takes you when you set it at an innkeeper or use it. Options > Use my hearthstone in the route."] = "路线中的炉石：当炉石就绪且旅店能让你更快到达下一步时，路线会有一个带炉石按钮的“炉石回到 <旅店>”步骤。你在旅店老板处绑定或使用炉石时，Questicus 会记住它带你去哪里。选项 > 在路线中使用我的炉石。"
t["A quest with a choice of rewards is never handed in on its own any more: Questicus shows the reward it would pick and why, and you press Take it (or choose another yourself)."] = "有可选奖励的任务不再自动交付：Questicus 会显示它会选择的奖励及原因，由你点击“拿取”（或自己选择其他奖励）。"
t["Quest tooltips on the map, minimap, tracker and dungeon window show what the quest says to do (the objective line from the quest log) and its quest ID. Right-click a quest in the tracker for a Wowhead link to copy; Alt-click one to share it with your group."] = "地图、小地图、追踪和地下城窗口中的任务提示会显示任务要求（日志中的目标行）及任务 ID。在追踪中右键点击任务可获得可复制的 Wowhead 链接；Alt-点击可与队伍共享。"
t["Quest tooltips list the reward items, and the items its chain ends with; hold Alt over the tooltip to see each item's own tooltip and compare them."] = "任务提示会列出奖励物品以及任务链最终给出的物品；在提示上按住 Alt 可查看每件物品自己的提示并进行比较。"
t["Respawn times count for every copy of a thing: a quest object (or mob) that comes under several ids with one name - the Pool of Tears' Atal'ai Artifacts - uses the respawn timed on any of them, so the arrow no longer sends you back to a spot after a minute when it takes seven to come back."] = "刷新时间适用于同一事物的所有副本：同名但有多个 ID 的任务物体（或怪物）- 比如泪水之池的阿塔莱神器 - 会使用其中任何一个测得的刷新时间，所以箭头不会再在需要七分钟时，一分钟后就把你送回原处。"
t["Empty quest-object spots are given up much sooner: with the object light on (the default) the game picks objects all around you, so within about 12 yards of the marker, a second or so with nothing there moves the arrow on - no need to stand right on it for several seconds."] = "空的任务物体位置会更快被放弃：开启物体光效（默认）时，游戏会选中你周围的物体，所以在标记约 11 码内一秒左右没有发现就会让箭头继续 - 不用再站在上面等好几秒。"
t["Dungeon window tidied up: the facts in a neat two-column table, and the quests with a status icon, a short status (Done, In your log, Eligible, Not eligible - why on hover, with + Route putting the start of its chain on your route) and the quests you can only pick up inside the dungeon in their own box, marked with the dungeon icon."] = "地下城窗口整理：信息以整齐的两列表格显示，任务带有状态图标和简短状态（已完成、在日志中、可接、不可接 - 鼠标悬停显示原因，+ 路线 会把任务链开头加入你的路线），只能在地下城内接取的任务单独放在带地下城图标的框中。"
t["Dungeon run step tidied up: one line, \"Run <dungeon>  1/5 quests done\". Expand opens each quest's name and what's left of it on short lines, instead of a wall of quest text. A Group finder button on it opens the game's group finder."] = "地下城步骤整理：一行“进行 <地下城>  已完成 1/5 个任务”。展开后用简短的行显示每个任务的名称和剩余内容，而不是一大段任务文本。上面的队伍查找器按钮会打开游戏的队伍查找器。"
t["Dungeon mode: the dungeon's quests sit together at the top of the quest tracker, under the dungeon's name on a purple band, apart from your other quests."] = "地下城模式：地下城的任务集中在任务追踪顶部，位于紫色条带上的地下城名称下方，与其他任务分开。"
t["On a flight the arrow says \"In flight to <place>\" with about how long is left, instead of pointing at the next step thousands of yards away."] = "飞行时箭头会显示“飞往 <地点>”和大约剩余时间，而不是指向数千码外的下一步。"
t["Quest dialog for ForeverDB: with \"Help fill the database\" on, every quest's texts (the offer, objectives, the \"have you got them?\" and the turn-in text) and the greetings above quest givers' lists are saved as the game shows them - your name, class and race are left out - so ForeverDB has WoW Forever's own words for every quest."] = "为 ForeverDB 记录任务对话：开启“帮助完善数据库”时，每个任务的文本（任务介绍、目标、“东西拿到了吗？”和交付文本）以及任务发布者列表上方的问候语会按游戏显示的样子保存 - 你的名字、职业和种族会被去掉 - 这样 ForeverDB 就有 WoW Forever 每个任务的原文。"
t["Stutters near walls gone: routes round walls are worked out in the background now (a few ms a frame) instead of all at once, and every leg of the route on the map is kept instead of being searched again on every redraw. The line and the arrow also no longer loop back to a corner you've already walked past."] = "墙边卡顿消失：绕墙路径现在在后台计算（每帧几毫秒），而不是一次性计算，地图上路线的每一段都会保留，不会在每次重绘时重新搜索。路线和箭头也不会再绕回你已经走过的拐角。"
t["The waypoint moves to the new step's spot even when it's close to the last one (it was left on the previous target), and \"Get the flight path\" steps lead to the flight master himself, by whatever name he goes (Wind Rider Master, Hippogryph Master, Bat Handler...)."] = "即使新步骤的位置离上一个很近，路径点也会移到新位置（之前会停在上一个目标），“获得飞行路线”步骤会带你去找飞行管理员本人，不管他叫什么（双足飞龙管理员、角鹰兽管理员、蝙蝠管理员……）。"
t["Dungeon mode: everything inside the dungeon - its objectives, hand-ins to someone or something in there (the Idol of Hakkar, ...) and quests you can only pick up in there - waits until you've got every quest you can get outside, instead of sending you in early. Quests that start inside no longer hold the run up. Outside dungeon mode, a finished quest whose hand-in is inside a dungeon is no longer a step that sends you in: it's handed in when you're in there."] = "地下城模式：地下城内的一切 - 目标、交给里面某人或某物的任务（哈卡神像……）以及只能在里面接的任务 - 都会等到你接完所有能在外面接的任务，而不是让你过早进去。在里面开始的任务不再拖延进度。不在地下城模式时，交付地点在地下城内的已完成任务不再是让你进去的步骤：你在里面时就会交付。"
t["Dungeon list and window: how many of the dungeon's quests are in your log as well as how many are done, and a \"picked up inside\" mark on quests you get in the dungeon itself."] = "地下城列表和窗口：显示该地下城有多少任务在你的日志中以及完成了多少，并给在地下城内获得的任务加上“在内部接取”标记。"
t["Waypoint in the world: a marker with a beam of light stands over where you're going, with the distance, when you'll get there and what it is (the step, your corpse, your own pin), coloured by what the step is. Close up it turns into a card over the target saying what it is; off screen a pointer at the edge shows which way to turn. Right-click to clear it. No other waypoint addon needed."] = "世界中的路径点：目的地上方会立起一道带光柱的标记，显示距离、预计到达时间和它是什么（步骤、你的尸体、你自己的标记），颜色取决于步骤类型。靠近后它会变成目标上方的卡片，说明是什么；不在屏幕内时，屏幕边缘的指针会告诉你该往哪边转。右键点击可清除。不再需要其他路径点插件。"
t["Your own waypoints: /way [zone] x y [name] (or /qway), /way paste for a list followed one after the other, /way clear, Ctrl-click on the minimap, a pin you put on the world map, or a map link clicked in chat - followed (arrow, map, marker in the world) until you get there, then the route again."] = "你自己的路径点：/way [区域] x y [名称]（或 /qway），/way paste 粘贴依次跟随的列表，/way clear，Ctrl-点击小地图，在世界地图上放置的图钉，或在聊天中点击的地图链接 - 一直跟随（箭头、地图、世界标记）直到到达，然后恢复路线。"
t["Waypoint options (Options > Waypoint, Waypoint look): pinpoint distance, edge pointer and its arrow, size, smaller with distance, opacity, beam, what's written under it, meters instead of yards, your own colours, showing it with the interface hidden, fade on mouse-over, and sounds for a new waypoint, getting close and walking away (/qc waysound for your own)."] = "路径点选项（选项 > 路径点、路径点外观）：精确标记距离、边缘指针及其箭头、大小、越远越小、不透明度、光柱、下方显示的内容、用米代替码、自己的颜色、隐藏界面时也显示、鼠标悬停时淡出，以及新路径点、靠近和离开时的音效（/qc waysound 可用自己的音效）。"
t["While you're a ghost the arrow leads you back to your corpse (\"Your corpse\", along the walkable path) and says when you're close enough to resurrect, the route line on the world map and minimap shows the path to it, the game's waypoint goes on it, and a corpse pin shows where it is on the world map and the minimap (at the minimap's edge when it's further). Back to the route once you're alive."] = "当你是灵魂时，箭头会沿可行走的路径带你回到尸体（“你的尸体”），并在足够近可以复活时提示；世界地图和小地图上的路线线条会显示通往尸体的路，游戏的路径点会放在尸体上，尸体图钉会在世界地图和小地图上显示它的位置（较远时显示在小地图边缘）。复活后恢复路线。"
t["Your findings now reach ForeverDB from inside the game: respawn times, new spawn points, zone border crossings and objects that only appear on a kill are passed quietly (addon messages, nothing in chat) to ForeverDB's collector when it's online in your guild or group, so the next ForeverDB update has them for everyone. Turn it off with \"Help fill the database\" in Options > Advanced; /qc relay shows how much got through."] = "你的发现现在可以直接从游戏中送到 ForeverDB：刷新时间、新刷新点、区域边界穿越以及只在击杀时出现的物体，会在 ForeverDB 的收集者在你的公会或队伍中在线时被悄悄（插件消息，聊天中不显示）传给它，这样下一次 ForeverDB 更新就会为所有人包含这些数据。可在选项 > 高级中关闭“帮助完善数据库”；/qc relay 显示已传送了多少。"
t["Checked walking paths: where ForeverDB has a checked walk for a route step, the arrow and the map follow it exactly instead of working the way out, and that walk isn't learned or recorded any more."] = "已核实的行走路径：当 ForeverDB 为某个路线步骤提供了已核实的行走路径时，箭头和地图会严格按它走，而不是自己计算路线，这条路径也不再被学习或记录。"
t["New spawn points: a quest mob standing next to you (out of combat) more than 30 yards from every spawn the database knows is added as a new spawn point - on your map, in the arrow's spots and in the route right away, and in ForeverDB for everyone with your recordings."] = "新刷新点：你旁边（非战斗中）的任务怪物若距离数据库中所有已知刷新点都超过 30 码，就会被添加为新刷新点 - 立即出现在你的地图、箭头位置和路线中，并随你的记录加入 ForeverDB 供所有人使用。"
t["Mob respawn times are learned while you play and used right away: a spot you killed at that still has no nameplate in view (not back yet), or is found back later, tightens its respawn time; the arrow re-times every skipped spot of that mob at once, and the route counts the wait for respawns when a quest needs more kills than there are spawns. Everything is saved for ForeverDB."] = "怪物刷新时间会在你游戏时学习并立即使用：你击杀过的位置如果视野中还没有姓名板（还没刷出来），或之后再次有怪，就会修正它的刷新时间；箭头会一次性重新计算该怪物所有被跳过的位置，当任务需要的击杀数多于刷新点数时，路线会把等待刷新的时间算进去。所有数据都会为 ForeverDB 保存。"
t["The route line on the map and minimap is smooth and solid now: no more stair steps and zig-zags from the path search, rounded corners - it never cuts over a wall (the arrow keeps the exact path)."] = "地图和小地图上的路线线条现在平滑连贯：没有路径搜索产生的台阶和锯齿，拐角是圆的 - 它从不穿墙（箭头保持精确路径）。"
t["Landing from a flight always moves the route on now: sometimes the game still said you were on the flight when it handed control back, and the \"Fly to\" step stayed after you'd landed."] = "飞行降落后路线总会继续：有时游戏交还控制权时仍认为你在飞行中，导致降落后“飞往”步骤还留着。"
t["Walking to a person, flight master, place or object is exact now: the arrow only turns at a corner once you're really there, an object's spot counts only when you stand on it, and explore spots need you inside - mobs keep the looser rules since they wander. Paths also go round walls marked in ForeverDB (and through the openings between them, however narrow), and the arrow only moves on from a corner round a wall's end once the way on is clear."] = "前往人物、飞行管理员、地点或物体现在很精确：箭头只有在你真正到达时才会在拐角转向，物体的位置只有站在上面才算，探索位置需要你进入其中 - 怪物会四处走动，所以规则更宽松。路径还会绕开 ForeverDB 中标记的墙（并穿过墙之间的缺口，不管多窄），箭头只有在路通了之后才会离开墙尽头的拐角。"
t["Walking between zones follows the real passes: the arrow, the route lines on the map, travel times and the choice of flight master all go through the known crossings between zones (via a third zone if that's the way), never straight over a zone line, and each stretch between crossings still goes round walls - no more being sent to Hammerfall from the Hinterlands."] = "区域间行走会走真实的通道：箭头、地图上的路线线条、行程时间和飞行管理员的选择都会经过区域间已知的通道（必要时经过第三个区域），绝不直线穿越区域边界，通道之间的每一段仍会绕墙 - 不会再从辛特兰把你送去落锤镇。"
t["The arrow no longer points away from the quest mobs in front of you: while a mob for the current objectives is in view (nameplate, target or soft target, not tagged by someone else) the arrow turns into its skull and says \"<mob> in view\" (\"right here\" when it's close) instead of pointing at a spawn marker that may be a different one. Within sight it also aims straight at the target instead of along a detour."] = "箭头不再指向远离你面前任务怪物的方向：只要当前目标的怪物在视野中（姓名板、目标或软目标，且未被他人占据），箭头就会变成它的骷髅并显示“<怪物> 在视野内”（靠近时显示“就在这里”），而不是指向可能是另一只怪的刷新标记。在视野内时也会直接指向目标，而不是绕路。"
t["The arrow no longer runs you round every kill spot to find them empty: with enemy nameplates on, spawns within nameplate range whose mob isn't up (no live nameplate, or tagged by someone else) are skipped from a distance until they respawn, and open again as soon as the mob shows up. Without nameplates you get a one-time tip to turn them on."] = "箭头不再带你跑遍每个刷怪点却发现是空的：开启敌方姓名板时，姓名板范围内怪物不在的刷新点（没有活着的姓名板，或被他人占据）会在远处就被跳过，直到刷新，怪物一出现就重新开放。没有开启姓名板时会提示你一次开启它们。"
t["Options > Stat weights: set how much each stat is worth to you, per role. Gear upgrades and quest reward picks use your numbers (scroll over a number to nudge it; Back to defaults undoes it)."] = "选项 > 属性权重：按职责设置每种属性对你的价值。装备提升和任务奖励选择会使用你的数值（在数值上滚动鼠标滚轮可微调；恢复默认可撤销）。"
t["Completionist routes now include WoW Forever's secret quest chains, starting with the Alcaz Operative Insignia (Alcaz Prison -> Moonbrook -> State Secrets), with step-by-step notes. Other routes leave secrets out."] = "全收集路线现在包含 WoW Forever 的秘密任务链，从奥卡兹特工徽章开始（Alcaz Prison -> 月溪镇 -> 国家机密），并附有逐步说明。其他路线不包含这些秘密。"
t["The arrow and the route now know WoW Forever's zone borders (from ForeverDB): paths stay off the mountains, walls and open sea between zones and go through the passes people really walk, travel times count the way round, and far targets in another zone are reached through a known crossing. Where you cross a border is recorded and shared through ForeverDB (/qc zone shows where you are)."] = "箭头和路线现在了解 WoW Forever 的区域边界（来自 ForeverDB）：路径会避开区域之间的山脉、墙和开阔海面，走人们真正走的通道，行程时间会计入绕路，另一个区域的远处目标会通过已知通道到达。你穿越边界的地点会被记录并通过 ForeverDB 共享（/qc zone 显示你的位置）。"
t["Objective steps now say how to do them: the quest's own instruction (\"Use the Holy Water on the corrupted Moonwell\"), the quest item to use and on what (with its key), and where each item drops from or is found."] = "目标步骤现在会说明怎么做：任务自己的说明（“在被腐蚀的月亮井使用圣水”）、要使用的任务物品及其对象（带按键），以及每件物品从哪里掉落或在哪里找到。"
t["Flights: on a flight path the arrow and the guide just say \"in flight\" (nothing is measured until you land), and every route you fly is timed once - the planner uses your real flight times from then on, and they go into the shared database with your recordings."] = "飞行：在飞行路线上，箭头和指引只显示“飞行中”（降落前不进行测量），你飞过的每条航线都会计时一次 - 之后规划会使用你的真实飞行时间，它们也会随你的记录加入共享数据库。"
t["The arrow and the route learn your way around much sooner: a wall, gate, cliff or mountain range you had to walk round is remembered (one long detour is enough), walks through caves and dungeons on the way are kept instead of dropped, ground you've walked yourself is preferred, and a chat line tells you when it learned something (/qc paths shows the last walk)."] = "箭头和路线会更快学会你的路：你不得不绕过的墙、大门、悬崖或山脉会被记住（绕一次远路就够），途经洞穴和地下城的行走会被保留而不是丢弃，优先选择你自己走过的地面，学到东西时聊天中会有一行提示（/qc paths 显示上一次行走）。"
t["Dungeon mode now finishes the chain quest you already have in the zone you're in before sending you elsewhere (e.g. Larion and Muigin in Un'Goro for the Sunken Temple): a chain step in your log was treated as already done, and quests across the sea looked \"on the way\" because the dungeon's own quests wait there."] = "地下城模式现在会先完成你在当前区域已有的任务链任务，再把你送去别处（例如为沉没的神庙在安戈洛环形山做的“拉瑞恩和穆尔金”）：之前日志中的任务链步骤会被当作已完成，海对面的任务因为地下城自己的任务在那边等着而看起来“顺路”。"
t["Dungeon mode no longer fills the route with endless \"Do <quest>\" steps for a finished quest of another zone in your log (e.g. It's a Secret to Everybody in Temple of Atal'Hakkar mode). A quest whose objectives have no known place now gets one step at most."] = "地下城模式不再因为日志中其他区域的已完成任务，而在路线中塞满无穷无尽的“完成 <任务>”步骤（例如阿塔哈卡神庙模式下的“人人皆知的秘密”）。目标没有已知地点的任务现在最多只有一个步骤。"
t["Auto accept only takes the quests your route has you pick up (or ones you added yourself). It used to accept any quest your settings allowed, so NPCs handed you quests the route had left out."] = "自动接受只会接受你的路线要你接的任务（或你自己添加的任务）。以前它会接受设置允许的任何任务，导致 NPC 给了你路线中已排除的任务。"
t["The \"Help calibrate Questicus\" respawn pop-up no longer shows for objects that only appear when you use an item on a mob or kill it (like Broodling Essence) - those have no respawn timer."] = "“帮助校准 Questicus”刷新窗口不再为那些只有对怪物使用物品或击杀怪物才会出现的物体弹出（比如雏龙精华）- 它们没有刷新时间。"
t["Much less lag and stutter while questing: the arrow and the map reuse the way they worked out instead of working it out again many times a second, the route is only planned again when a quest is taken, done or an objective finishes (at most every 5 seconds, never in collection mode), and opening, zooming and keeping the world map open makes much less garbage."] = "做任务时卡顿大大减少：箭头和地图会重复使用已计算好的路线，而不是每秒重新计算很多次，路线只会在接受或完成任务、或目标完成时重新规划（最多每 5 秒一次，收集模式下从不），打开、缩放和保持世界地图打开时产生的垃圾数据也少得多。"
t["Much less memory churn (the stutters every few seconds): minimap icons are only redrawn when you've moved, turned or the route changed, tooltips are made only when you point at an icon, and opening the world map no longer builds megabytes of temporary data."] = "内存周转大大减少（每隔几秒的卡顿）：小地图图标只在你移动、转向或路线变化时重绘，提示只在你指向图标时才生成，打开世界地图也不再生成好几 MB 的临时数据。"
t["The route no longer sends you to quest givers who won't talk to you: quests that need reputation you don't have, quests from a faction you're unfriendly or hostile with (like Timbermaw before you've earned them), and quests whose NPCs you've seen are hostile to you are left out until that changes."] = "路线不再把你送到不会和你说话的任务发布者那里：需要你没有的声望的任务、来自你冷淡或敌对阵营的任务（例如尚未赢得好感的木喉要塞），以及 NPC 已被发现对你敌对的任务，在情况改变前都会被排除。"
t["Highlights: ore, herbs, quest objects, chests and your fishing bobber light up as you come up to them, with 15 light effects, the object's name and icon, colours per kind of object, and a live preview (Options > Highlights, or /qc glow)."] = "高亮：矿石、草药、任务物体、宝箱和你的鱼漂在你靠近时会亮起，有 15 种光效、物体的名称和图标、按物体类型区分的颜色和实时预览（选项 > 高亮，或 /qc glow）。"
t["Questicus now records much more for the shared quest database while you play (money and skinning per creature, fishing per zone, flight prices, trainers and every ability's training cost, everything vendors sell with its price, limits, token costs and requirements, quest details and reputation, which quests NPCs really offer, rares, subzones, encounters, gathering skill levels) - /qc recorded shows what it has. Turn it off under Options > Advanced."] = "Questicus 现在会在你游戏时为共享任务数据库记录更多内容（每种生物的金钱和剥皮、每个区域的钓鱼、飞行价格、训练师及每个技能的训练费用、商人出售的所有物品及价格、限购、代币花费和需求、任务详情和声望、NPC 实际提供的任务、稀有怪物、子区域、首领战、采集技能等级）- /qc recorded 显示已记录的内容。可在选项 > 高级中关闭。"
t["Highlights options: hide the light in combat, in instances, on things you can't use yet or on herbs and ore without the profession; ignore objects; pick the range and direction; set the interact key; cut the light out around your character; alternate Find Herbs and Find Minerals if you have both."] = "高亮选项：在战斗中、副本中、对你还不能使用的东西或没有专业的草药和矿石隐藏光效；忽略物体；选择范围和方向；设置互动按键；在你的角色周围镂空光效；同时拥有两个采集专业时交替使用寻找草药和寻找矿物。"
t["Vendor gear on the route: no more plain white items (weapons still count), and only when buying it still leaves enough gold for your class training at the next level (what your trainer showed you, or what other players' trainers showed - every ability's training cost is now recorded and shared through the database)."] = "路线中的商人装备：不再包含普通白色物品（武器仍然计算），并且只有在购买后仍有足够金币支付下一级的职业训练费用时才会推荐（你的训练师显示的费用，或其他玩家的训练师显示的费用 - 每个技能的训练费用现在都会被记录并通过数据库共享）。"
t["Quests that let you choose a profession book (Mining for Dummies, Wild Harvest, Pelt Collecting for Beginners ...) are never handed in with a pick made for you: the reward window stays open so you choose."] = "需要选择专业书的任务（采矿入门、野外采集、剥皮入门……）绝不会替你做出选择后交付：奖励窗口会保持打开，由你自己选择。"
t["Kill and collect objectives: the arrow points to the closest spot, leaning toward your next step so you work through the area in that direction. Spots you just cleared, or where there was nothing, are skipped until they respawn; respawn times are measured while you play and shared through the database (1 minute until one is known). A quest object nobody has timed yet asks you once to wait for it to come back, so no one else has to. /qc respawn shows them."] = "击杀和收集目标：箭头指向最近的位置，并偏向你的下一步，让你朝那个方向推进。你刚清空或没有东西的位置会被跳过直到刷新；刷新时间会在游戏中测量并通过数据库共享（未知时为 1 分钟）。还没人计时过的任务物体会请你等它刷新一次，这样其他人就不必再等。/qc respawn 显示这些时间。"
t["The options window is tidied into sections (General, Questing, Map & minimap, Tracker & alerts, Dungeons, Highlights, Advanced), each a short page with plainer wording; closing the highlight settings takes you back to it."] = "选项窗口整理成多个部分（常规、任务、地图和小地图、追踪和提醒、地下城、高亮、高级），每个都是用语更简单的短页面；关闭高亮设置会回到选项窗口。"
t["Collect-from-object quests (like Harvesting Windstones) no longer get sent to the back of the route because a creature you had just killed was taken for where the items come from; abandoning and retaking a quest is planned fresh; the guide's \"Done:\" line now reads \"Last step:\" so it isn't mistaken for the quest being finished."] = "从物体上收集的任务（如收集风之石）不会再因为你刚击杀的生物被误认为物品来源而被排到路线末尾；放弃后重新接受的任务会重新规划；指引的“已完成：”一行现在改为“上一步：”，以免被误认为任务已完成。"
t["Quest XP, gold and reward items now always come from the game itself (your quest log, the quest windows, what you really got) instead of the database whenever the game has shown them; differences are saved so the shared database gets corrected."] = "任务经验、金币和奖励物品现在只要游戏显示过，就总是来自游戏本身（你的日志、任务窗口、你实际获得的东西），而不是来自数据库；差异会被保存，以修正共享数据库。"
t["Routes skip quests other players found their quest giver doesn't offer yet."] = "路线会跳过其他玩家发现任务发布者尚未提供的任务。"
t["Collection mode now turns every Questicus feature off - map and minimap icons, nameplate marks and tooltip lines, the quest tracker, pop-ups, the quest item button, the boss tracker and highlights - and back on when you leave it."] = "收集模式现在会关闭 Questicus 的所有功能 - 地图和小地图图标、姓名板标记和提示行、任务追踪、弹出提示、任务物品按钮、首领追踪和高亮 - 离开收集模式时再重新开启。"
t["Opening the world map no longer redraws the quest areas when nothing has changed."] = "在没有任何变化时，打开世界地图不再重绘任务区域。"
t["Fixed an error (\"secret number value\") with the world map open while another addon's frames were in combat."] = "修复了在其他插件的窗口处于战斗中时打开世界地图出现的错误（“secret number value”）。"
t["The What's new window keeps its text inside the window, waits until you've answered the setup questions, and on a first install shows only the latest version's notes."] = "更新内容窗口会把文字保持在窗口内，等你回答完设置问题后才显示，首次安装时只显示最新版本的说明。"
t["Mob tooltips show about how much money a kill drops and, if you know Skinning, what skinning it gives (real WoW: Forever counts from Drop Tables). /qc mobinfo turns it off."] = "怪物提示会显示一次击杀大约掉多少钱，如果你会剥皮，还会显示剥皮能获得什么（来自 Drop Tables 的 WoW: Forever 真实数据）。/qc mobinfo 可关闭。"
t["The yellow waypoint marker no longer covers the step icon on the world map: it turns see-through while it sits on the icon."] = "黄色路径点标记不再遮住世界地图上的步骤图标：它位于图标上时会变成半透明。"
t["The world map window's close and full-screen buttons are no longer hidden under the quest log's search bar."] = "世界地图窗口的关闭和全屏按钮不再被任务日志的搜索栏挡住。"
t["Boss tracker: every boss gets its own still, round portrait (no more blank skulls or moving models), and names sit under the pictures instead of running over them."] = "首领追踪：每个首领都有自己静止的圆形头像（不再有空白骷髅或会动的模型），名字放在图片下方，而不是压在图片上。"
t["Boss tracker: a boss you've killed this run turns into a skull with a tick; hover it to see what it dropped and who got it."] = "首领追踪：本轮中你击杀的首领会变成带勾的骷髅；鼠标悬停可查看它掉落了什么以及谁拿到了。"
t["The yellow waypoint marker on Questicus Maps' stitched map now goes under Questicus' step icon too."] = "Questicus Maps 拼接地图上的黄色路径点标记现在也会位于 Questicus 步骤图标下方。"
t["The quest log's search bar keeps the size it has while you type, instead of stretching when it's empty."] = "任务日志的搜索栏在输入时保持大小，不会在为空时被拉伸。"
t["The quest log's search bar on the world map no longer flickers or covers the buttons beside it."] = "世界地图上任务日志的搜索栏不再闪烁，也不再遮住旁边的按钮。"
t["The game's yellow waypoint marker now sits under Questicus' step icon on the world map, so you can read the step and its number."] = "游戏的黄色路径点标记现在位于世界地图上 Questicus 步骤图标的下方，你可以看清步骤和编号。"
t["The quest log no longer collapses and reopens every so often while you quest, and quest areas aren't redrawn as you walk between the spots of the same step (the map pin only moves when your route moves on to another step)."] = "做任务时任务日志不再时不时折叠又展开，在同一步骤的各位置之间走动时任务区域也不再重绘（地图图钉只在路线进入下一步时移动）。"
t["The world map no longer redraws quest areas and icons all the time. They're drawn once and only redrawn when your route changes, you accept or hand in a quest, or after a loading screen. Only the line from you to your current step follows you as you move."] = "世界地图不再一直重绘任务区域和图标。它们只绘制一次，只有在路线变化、你接受或交付任务、或加载画面之后才会重绘。只有从你到当前步骤的线会跟着你移动。"
t["Map icons no longer flash big for a moment while you zoom or drag the world map, or when quest areas are redrawn."] = "缩放或拖动世界地图、或重绘任务区域时，地图图标不再瞬间放大闪烁。"
t["The quest log's search bar on the world map no longer stretches off past the quest log."] = "世界地图上任务日志的搜索栏不再延伸到任务日志之外。"
t["Questicus now tells you when a newer version is out (it checks with guild and group members who use it)."] = "Questicus 现在会在有新版本时通知你（它会向使用它的公会和队伍成员确认）。"
t["Patch notes: after an update, the first time you log in you'll see what's new. Type /qc news to see them again."] = "更新说明：更新后第一次登录时你会看到更新内容。输入 /qc news 可再次查看。"
t["With escort quests turned off, escort quests (like Ringo in Un'Goro) no longer end up on your route."] = "关闭护送任务后，护送任务（比如安戈洛环形山的林格）不会再出现在你的路线中。"
t["The quest tracker's fold button sits in the far right corner, and the title bar stays put when you fold or unfold it."] = "任务追踪的折叠按钮位于最右侧角落，折叠或展开时标题栏保持不动。"
t["The route window remembers where you put it when you open it from Command Center or the minimap button."] = "从 Command Center 或小地图按钮打开路线窗口时，它会记住你放置的位置。"
t["The minimap button follows Command Center's minimap shape, and route lines fit square minimaps."] = "小地图按钮会跟随 Command Center 的小地图形状，路线线条也适配方形小地图。"
t["The quest tracker can be resized (drag the corner, right-click it to fit) and scrolls when your quests don't fit."] = "任务追踪可以调整大小（拖动角落，右键点击自动适配），任务放不下时可以滚动。"
t["The quest tracker can be folded down to its title bar."] = "任务追踪可以折叠到只剩标题栏。"
t["Boss portraits show the first time you open the boss tracker."] = "第一次打开首领追踪时就会显示首领头像。"
t["The level and time-to-level text no longer overlaps the route window's title when the window is narrow."] = "路线窗口较窄时，等级和升级所需时间的文字不再与窗口标题重叠。"
t["Stat priority in the setup questions is now picked from a drop-down list."] = "设置问题中的属性优先级现在从下拉列表中选择。"
t["Dungeon run history: time, gold, XP and loot (and who got it) for every run, with averages. Type /qc runs."] = "地下城记录：每一轮的用时、金币、经验和掉落（以及谁拿到），并附平均值。输入 /qc runs。"
t["Pictures for every dungeon in the list."] = "列表中的每个地下城都有图片了。"
t["Boss kills in your current run are tracked more reliably."] = "更可靠地记录当前这一轮中的首领击杀。"
t["The quest list on a dungeon's page scrolls."] = "地下城页面上的任务列表可以滚动。"
t["The boss tracker's low profile mode no longer has text running into the buttons."] = "首领追踪的精简模式不再有文字压到按钮上。"
t["Every WoW Forever dungeon is in the dungeon list, with its real bosses."] = "WoW Forever 的每个地下城都在地下城列表中，并带有真实的首领。"
t["Low profile boss tracker - click a boss name for its loot."] = "精简首领追踪 - 点击首领名字查看其掉落。"
t["The dungeon list shows how many of its quests you've done; finished dungeons turn green with a check."] = "地下城列表显示你完成了其中多少任务；全部完成的地下城会变成绿色并带勾。"
t["Dungeon pages show the average gold per run and the state of each quest (done, ready to get, or needs a chain first), with a button to add a chain to your route."] = "地下城页面显示每轮平均金币和每个任务的状态（已完成、可接，或需要先完成任务链），并有一个把任务链加入路线的按钮。"
t["All zones, including the new WoW Forever zones, are in the zone list."] = "所有区域，包括 WoW Forever 的新区域，都在区域列表中。"
t["Quest NPCs no longer show up in boss lists."] = "任务 NPC 不再出现在首领列表中。"
t["The map pictures are included in the download again."] = "下载中重新包含了地图图片。"
